    "detailed_description": "<u><strong>Welcome to Loco Limbo !</strong></u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956550/extras/4461bf38c4b63bb1a247171fdb8a356a.poster.avif?t=1741682246\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956550/extras/4461bf38c4b63bb1a247171fdb8a356a.webm?t=1741682246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956550/extras/4461bf38c4b63bb1a247171fdb8a356a.mp4?t=1741682246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A <strong>hilarious </strong>and chaotic <strong>physical survival sandbox game</strong> set on a mysterious island! <br>Master the <strong>bizarre </strong>ability to <strong><u>detach and control your own limbs</u></strong> as you try to survive...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956550/extras/b599f361232fbcd0e179cfcfc9d12f1d.poster.avif?t=1741682246\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956550/extras/b599f361232fbcd0e179cfcfc9d12f1d.webm?t=1741682246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956550/extras/b599f361232fbcd0e179cfcfc9d12f1d.mp4?t=1741682246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>Key Features:</u></strong> <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Unique Limb-Control Mechanics:</strong> Detach and control your limbs to survive <br></li><li><strong>Physics-Driven Sandbox Gameplay:</strong> Prepare for unpredictable laughs as you fling your limbs around in absurd situations.<br></li><li><strong>Darkly Humorous Storyline:</strong> Unravel the mysteries of the island with a touch of humor.<br></li><li><strong>Survival Challenges: </strong>Gather resources, build shelters, and fend off dangers in an ever-changing environment.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956550/extras/3c0413af90753fb3b013ef877dabc982.poster.avif?t=1741682246\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956550/extras/3c0413af90753fb3b013ef877dabc982.webm?t=1741682246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956550/extras/3c0413af90753fb3b013ef877dabc982.mp4?t=1741682246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956550/extras/8d85f1cca261135003ec7643faa8118c.poster.avif?t=1741682246\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956550/extras/8d85f1cca261135003ec7643faa8118c.webm?t=1741682246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956550/extras/8d85f1cca261135003ec7643faa8118c.mp4?t=1741682246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
